763e363f-0bd7-4d5b-96d3-aac270df14b7	224	951b8951-f037-473b-8613-7eb83b8c5bfd	wiki	wiki_create	needs_review	Would create a new wiki page	0.88	Gym Equipment in Humid Climates	Create a concise local-know-how page about humidity’s effects on gym equipment.	{"plan": {"title": "Gym Equipment in Humid Climates", "action": "create", "category": "Local Know-How", "find_text": "", "operation": "create", "anchor_text": "", "append_text": "In Costa Rica, humidity can rust metal gym equipment, damage switches, and make rubber bands brittle. Electronic workout machines are best kept in an air-conditioned or humidity-controlled room rather than outdoors.", "target_slug": "gym-equipment-in-humid-climates", "subject_name": "gym equipment in Costa Rica", "proposed_fact": "humidity can damage equipment; keep electronic machines in a climate-controlled room", "change_summary": "Create a concise local-know-how page about humidity’s effects on gym equipment.", "replacement_text": "", "needs_clarification": false, "clarification_question": ""}, "topic": "Gym equipment in humid climates", "statement": "In Costa Rica, humidity can rust metal gym equipment, damage switches and make rubber bands brittle; electronic workout machines are best kept in an air-conditioned or humidity-controlled room rather than outdoors.", "searchTerms": ["gym equipment", "humidity", "Costa Rica", "equipo de gimnasio", "humedad"], "plannedVersion": null}	[{"text": "Even with every day use, my barbell handles are all rusty. Clips/metal parts on bands are rusting just from the humidity. I used to have an elliptical outside and as with every single appliance, the switches eventually gave up. Worst are the \\"hidden\\" switches that have a plastic ", "group": "MV - Neighbors (No Sales and No Promo)", "sender": "Denes", "sent_at": "2026-10-05T16:19:47+00:00", "contacts": []}]	\N	gym-equipment-in-humid-climates	\N	2026-10-06 12:04:33.297627+00	\N	\N
