rk of art can become a big helping hand.\n\n📍 Mercado de la Tierra – Ecovilla San Mateo\n🗓️ This Sunday\n🕙 10:00 a.m. – 3:00 p.m.\n\nCome celebrate the animals you love, discover their stories, and be part of this network of support. 🐾💚\n\nMore information:\namigosanimales.machuca.info	[]	\N	\N	2026-10-05 02:02:22.242979+00	backfill	+50671632550
