ercado\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"293d5c55-1726-4113-a256-ca1b7fb28d6a\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/XTeYk8QyjAxmXUxY7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Green Center Organic Super Market\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - this is the ultimate “Whole Foods” of Costa Rica. You will usually find almost everything here that you can’t in other stores. Yes, it’s pricey, and yes, it’s not quite Whole Foods :)\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"9f78e53a-d44d-4d66-9473-5f433d40515a\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/fX54XAhwJqoViGMp7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Nueces Industriales\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - Almonds, Walnuts, Cashews, Hazelnuts, etc. All kind of nuts in bulk quantities and excellent prices. Go here once every month or so and stock up on all your nutty needs.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"a60be0d4-5c51-4792-bc3a-840275b59da0\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.instagram.com/donluispanes/\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Don Luis Panes\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - Gluten Free bakery with excellent bread.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"23d1b126-51f3-4922-8813-beb963f8b2b4\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"defau