a941d69c-34d5-44e3-9d6d-e5b1a35599cb	food-stores	Food Stores & Farmers Markets	"[{\\"id\\":\\"bf6536ce-2e2b-41cf-89f8-2564640b9f97\\",\\"type\\":\\"heading\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\",\\"level\\":3},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Supermarkets\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"47a53caa-167c-4989-8d1e-743c38fa95cc\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/vmGtq92b97MXcAoq7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Auto Mercado - Plaza Herradura\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - this is the easiest one to drive to, takes about 40 minutes and avoids the main highway. You can also combine this easily with a beach stop.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"53ca0c94-8c92-4809-85c9-573792e4ebd4\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/U2Enpq2fQGsjtPFR7\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Auto Mercado - Guácima\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - this is the closest one in San Jose area, it will have a very similar selection to the one in Herradura.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"39379688-744b-4446-882b-9992528b58dd\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/Zycub971F7NWUkBr8\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"PriceSmart\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - Costco of Costa Rica. Your once-a-quarter trip to load up on essentials and occasional hard to find things. Good prices, large packages. Membership required, but 1 year will only cost $40 or so.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"956a1b09-b7e0-48c9-89c5-a6823e26ed91\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"3c42d91f-19a2-4aaf-a5e1-4b11297f9747\\",\\"type\\":\\"heading\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\",\\"level\\":3},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Local Supermarkets\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"5eebd78d-acd3-4f54-b731-94415bc389ee\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/BYGyvkFq44r9PX7R6\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Peri Orotina\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - local supermarket that actually has some decent selection of Gluten Free goods, decent chocolate and other things that you'd normally travel much further for.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"dab96ea4-f625-4249-830b-38732b6cf054\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://goo.gl/maps/sdthGDdwmsfUQUa66\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Gran Bodega\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" - another great local store with good produce section.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"70bde780-68d6-4cb0-a39e-402b2205dde1\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\