a2f89f83-389c-465f-8d96-1e4ab90f3ff2	learning-spanish	Learning Spanish	"[{\\"id\\":\\"455f64c2-b271-4cf6-b317-2d737255cc73\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"We have local Spanish Teachers in the area - see Events and Services chat for latest offerings.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"0d815d50-277b-459e-880c-f451880cbc66\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"dfe34a0e-a95b-4648-a9fb-e39309a5de29\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Language Transfer Series is an alternative way to learn Spanish that many have found helpful: \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLeA5t3dWTWvvwf5fw0Nl7mVk0OUjP1Ln2\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLeA5t3dWTWvvwf5fw0Nl7mVk0OUjP1Ln2\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" \\\\nAlso available on Soundcloud since its Audio Only: \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://www.languagetransfer.org/free-courses-1\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://www.languagetransfer.org/free-courses-1\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"22efd933-90ca-40e7-9973-a1d9f083ed97\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"For passive / fun learning, the Dreaming Spanish video series is great to pick-up comprehension skills:\\