67a05dfb-c266-49fd-bd8e-297c7f3ce84d	housing	Housing	"[{\\"id\\":\\"e33335c2-4453-4961-846d-afaa05a4b6f1\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"There are two main ways to find local housing: \\",\\"styles\\":{}},{\\"type\\":\\"link\\",\\"href\\":\\"https://machucahomes.com/\\",\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"https://machucahomes.com/\\",\\"styles\\":{}}]},{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\" and MV Housing and Rentals WhatsApp Group.  \\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"fa587c1f-2845-4866-bc9d-1cf5727ec6d8\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"ef5817f7-6c9e-463f-ade9-5b3fe9d8e473\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"For tico-style houses which are often cheaper and sometimes just as nice, connect with <fill in>\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"a44dc496-f7ba-497f-8ec6-e5f8107cd70b\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]}]"	A page about Housing	2025-03-27 22:19:37.915962+00	2025-03-27 22:20:49.578+00	\N	f	Local Know-How	1	'-2845':57 '-4453':4 '-4866':58 '-4961':5 '-846':6 '1cf5727ec6d8':61 '463f':77 '497f':115 '5b3fe9d8e473':79 '6c9e':76 '8ec6':116 'a44dc496':113 'a44dc496-f7ba-497f-8ec6-e5f8107cd70b':112 'ade9':78 'afaa05a4b6f1':9 'backgroundcolor':15,67,85,123 'bc9d':60 'bc9d-1cf5727ec6d8':59 'cheaper':101 'children':54,72,110,128 'connect':107 'content':19,37,71,89,127 'd':8 'd-afaa05a4b6f1':7 'default':14,16,66,68,84,86,122,124 'e33335c2':3 'e5f8107cd70b':117 'ef5817f7':75 'ef5817f7-6c9e-463f-ade9-5b3fe9d8e473':74 'f7ba':114 'fa587c1f':56 'find':29 'group':52 'hous':1,31,48,97 'href':35 'id':2,55,73,111 'left':18,70,88,126 'link':34 'local':30 'machucahomes.com':36,41 'main':26 'mv':47 'nice':106 'often':100 'paragraph':11,63,81,119 'prop':12,64,82,120 'rental':50 'sometim':103 'style':32,42,53,96,109 'text':21,22,39,40,44,45,91,92 'textalign':17,69,87,125 'textcolor':13,65,83,121 'tico':95 'tico-styl':94 'two':25 'type':10,20,33,38,43,62,80,90,118 'way':27 'whatsapp':51
1f0667f8-3639-4bbb-8207-d0519663c9bd	ants	Ants	"[{\\"id\\":\\"ec7a1693-d55d-4c0f-b00c-5f2fe0fcf27a\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Ants is a common challenge in houses.  However there are ways to deal with it without completely destroying the ants:\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"afd5370b-3754-4a1b-bb79-4d8434a538a7\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"3fe0f550-19c5-4cc8-a616-ac903dd864dc\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"I use straight white vinegar in a spray bottle. Spray all their trails and them. Works great! (requires regular application, but is pet and kids safe!)\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"9a40e234-ffc1-49ec-8321-7359b0ec1a93\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Straight oregano oil has been known to work too\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"2cc3e268-a26e-41e5-bc47-a4c2ebb267a5\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Borax\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"e3d50e2f-5b97-492c-a92a-e1ac23c4b236\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Wipe down the areas with Tea Tree or Oregano Oil. And make sure you never leave food or garbage around. It will reduce them significantly.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"0a1d1452-3e9d-4714-b795-e0d2dece6832\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"\\\\nIt also helps to have regular habits of cleaning all crumbs, drips and dishes immediately. Not an easy ask for renters. Those little ants have decided your house is a cash cow, but they will lose interest if there’s no food and regular disruption from vinegar and just wiping them up and washing them down the drain. It will get better!!\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"d1d4b49e-b1c9-4a71-aef9-a019268592d4\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"\\\\nThe \\\\\\"Lets just kill em!\\\\\\" method (no moral judgement, but keep in mind they were there first...)\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"7f606cfe-ab8a-4a3b-973d-2ba30ea9c7bb\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Ants can't resist honey!\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"5266672e-51b2-4394-b857-8739ef6d2506\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Half a cup of honey\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"28f26ad2-98b0-4551-81d2-4d44c4fa27d5\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"1/4 of a cup of borax\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"73418dea-b491-4db5-bd31-6c8360d57941\\",\\"type\\":\\"bulletListItem\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"2 tablespoons of water\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"1294cb36-74aa-41ca-b990-416e25b78297\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[{\\"type\\":\\"text\\",\\"text\\":\\"Ratio of honey to borax is 2:1 - e.g if use 1tsp of borax need to use 2tsp of honey. The ants take the disguised borax back to their nest which kills the rest of the ants. Set multiple honey traps up by placing the honey/borax mixture in upturned jar lids in key spots next to their trails as there can be multiple nests in one house.\\",\\"styles\\":{}}],\\"children\\":[]},{\\"id\\":\\"c375a13b-7d2a-45fc-946c-718cd0231f1a\\",\\"type\\":\\"paragraph\\",\\"props\\":{\\"textColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"backgroundColor\\":\\"default\\",\\"textAlignment\\":\\"left\\"},\\"content\\":[],\\"children\\":[]}]"	A page about Ants	2025-03-27 22:28:25.705423+00	2025-03-27 22:29:26.262+00	\N	t	Local Know-How	1	'-3754':46 '-4':47 '-4394':367 '-7359':117 '-81':396 '0a1d1452':215 '0a1d1452-3e9d':214 '1':474 '1/4':413 '1294cb36':449 '1294cb36-74aa-41ca-b990-416e25b78297':448 '19c5':66 '1tsp':478 '2':441,473 '28f26ad2':393 '28f26ad2-98b0':392 '2ba30ea9c7bb':343 '2cc3e268':145 '2cc3e268-a26e-41e5-bc47-a4c2ebb267a5':144 '2tsp':484 '3e9d':216 '3fe0f550':65 '3fe0f550-19c5-4cc8-a616-ac903dd864dc':64 '416e25b78297':453 '41ca':451 '41e5':147 '4551':395 '45fc':540 '4714':217 '492c':170 '49ec':115 '4a3b':341 '4a71':302 '4c0f':6 '4cc8':67 '4d44c4fa27d5':399 '4d8434a538a7':51 '4db5':425 '5266672e-51':365 '5b97':169 '5f2fe0fcf27a':8 '6c83